            <div type="edition" xml:space="preserve">
                <ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="I"><lb n="1"/>] ị-te-ọ-..-..-..-j̣ạ [  ←</div><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="II"><lb n="1"/>θησαυρὸν Κυπρίαι κ̣αὶ̣ [Ὀρε]σ̣θ̣έως εἰ[κόνα] μορ̣[φ]ῆ̣[ς]<lb n="2"/>υἱοῦ τήνδε ἀνέθηκε Ἀνδ̣ρο̣κλῆς βασιλεύς.</div></ab>
            </div>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="DE" resp="Klaus Hallof"><ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="I"><lb n="1"/>[<hi rend="italic">eteokyprisch</hi>]</div><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="II"><lb n="1"/>Die Schatztruhe und diese Bildgestalt hier hat der kyprischen (Aphrodite) des Orestheus<lb n="2"/>Sohn geweiht, der König Androkles.</div></ab></div>
            <div type="bibliography">
